{"id": "caltrain-electric-fleet-warranty-delays", "title": "Caltrain attributed 1,060 minutes of October train delays to warranty issues", "seconds": 45.6, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "16fade023e1bb028", "words": 127, "beats": [{"scene": "d", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In October 2026, Caltrain attributed 1,060 train-delay minutes to Stadler warranty issues.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 6.37, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["1,060", "minutes"], "sub": "October warranty delays"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.61, 0.9, 1.83, 2.36, 2.88, 3.09, 3.5, 3.88, 4.47, 4.77, 4.9, 5.34, 5.76]}, {"scene": "d", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In September, that figure was 392 minutes.", "t0": 6.49, "t1": 9.85, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "record", "context": "Caltrain service", "heading": "Warranty delay minutes", "layout": "relationship", "source": "advisory", "rows": [{"icon": "calendar", "label": "September 2026", "value": "392 minutes"}, {"icon": "calendar", "label": "October 2026", "value": "1,060 minutes"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 1.06, 1.31, 1.62, 1.8, 2.11, 2.45, 2.98]}, {"scene": "d", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Caltrain counts other mechanical delays separately.", "t0": 9.97, "t1": 12.49, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Caltrain counts other mechanical delays separately"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.53, 0.82, 1.03, 1.53, 1.91]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In August, electric trains averaged 19,200 miles between failures.", "t0": 12.71, "t1": 17.05, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "4,124 miles", "label": "October miles between failures"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.7, 1.14, 1.5, 1.84, 2.27, 2.67, 2.89, 3.16, 3.49, 3.82]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "By October, that distance had fallen to 4,124 miles.", "t0": 17.17, "t1": 21.38, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "By October, that distance had fallen to 4,124 miles"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.86, 1.1, 1.45, 1.59, 1.9, 2.02, 2.28, 2.75, 2.95, 3.22, 3.77]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The railroad needs 14 electric trainsets for weekday service.", "t0": 21.5, "t1": 24.93, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fleet", "kicker": "October availability", "text": "99%", "mark": "99%"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.63, 0.89, 1.36, 1.78, 2.35, 2.54, 2.97]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In October it had 99% of that requirement available on an average day.", "t0": 25.05, "t1": 29.31, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "In October it had 99% of that requirement available on an average day"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.81, 1.01, 1.18, 1.69, 2.03, 2.11, 2.27, 2.79, 3.33, 3.48, 3.59, 3.92]}, {"scene": "m", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Caltrain budgeted $7 million for technical support and spare parts in fiscal 2026.", "t0": 29.53, "t1": 34.66, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "support", "kicker": "FY2026 adopted budget", "text": "$7 million", "mark": "$7 million"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.54, 0.98, 1.3, 1.63, 1.94, 2.09, 2.51, 2.93, 3.03, 3.37, 3.67, 3.8, 4.17, 4.46]}, {"scene": "m", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "That agreement also pays for training and scheduled maintenance.", "t0": 34.78, "t1": 37.49, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "That agreement also pays for training and scheduled maintenance"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.58, 0.92, 1.18, 1.32, 1.68, 1.78, 2.21]}, {"scene": "m", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The records leave open how much each warranty repair cost and whether Caltrain received a credit."